ty=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1200 1200w, https://platform.cagesideseats.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/54/2026/11/gettyimages-2261803428.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1440 1440w, https://platform.cagesideseats.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/54/2026/11/gettyimages-2261803428.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=1920 1920w, https://platform.cagesideseats.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/54/2026/11/gettyimages-2261803428.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2048 2048w, https://platform.cagesideseats.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/54/2026/11/gettyimages-2261803428.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400 2400w" src="https://platform.cagesideseats.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/54/2026/11/gettyimages-2261803428.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=2400"/></div></div><div class="duet--media--caption v1joan1 v1joan0"><figcaption class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup _1mt21p02 v1joanb v1joana">(Photo by Kevin Sabitus/WWE Via Getty Images)</figcaption> <cite class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup _1mt21p02 v1joan6 v1joan5">WWE via Getty Images</cite></div></div></div></div><div class="_1ruizz65"><div class="n4h9mg1 n4h9mg0"><div class="bifr1q0 bifr1q1"><div class="bifr1q5"><a class="bifr1q6" href="/authors/claire-elizabeth">Claire Elizabeth</a> <span class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup bifr1q7">knows the names of all the moves and is a decent typist but has too much social anxiety to be someone’s secretary so instead she’s been liveblogging shows here at Cageside Seats since 2016.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="zephr-anchor" class="_1upudxk13"><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">WWE <em>NXT</em> is live tonight (Nov. 24, 2026) from the WWE Performance Center in Orlando, Florida, and tonight’s show continues the build to <em>TLC: Tables, Ladders, and Chairs</em> next month!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Advertised for tonight: Excellent weirdo Shiloh Hill goes toe-to-toe with big bad Mason Rook for a chance at Grayson Waller’s NXT Men’s Championship!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Plus, Izzi Dame challenges Zaria for the NXT Women’s North American Championship and atomicos action pits the full Vanity Project including Myka Lockwood against Hank and Tank and Noam and Romeo! Get ready with our preview <strong><a href="/wwe/488262/wwe-nxt-preview-nov-24-2026-zaria-izzi-history-tonight-north-american-championship">here</a></strong>!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Come right back here back at the normal start time of 8 pm ET. That’s when the <em>NXT</em> live blog will kick off in the space below once the show starts on the CW.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><div id="wwe-nxt-results-and-live-blog-for-nov-24" class="llmywu3 llmywu0 duet--article--standard-heading _1mt21p01"><h4 class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup">WWE <em>NXT </em>RESULTS AND LIVE BLOG FOR NOV. 24</h4></div></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">In a pain that buckles out your knees, could you stop this if I plead? So destined I am to walk among the dark, liveblogging this here pro wrestling show for you, folks.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">The show opens with the usual montage of talent arriving at the arena and then a recap of last week’s NXT Women’s Championship main event that ended in a disqualification victory for Kendal Grey.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Kendal Grey makes her entrance in street clothes and Vic Joseph introduces Byron Saxton as his color commentator for tonight.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Grey gets on the mic and says she’s gotta be honest, last week had her speechless. She’s worked so hard to come back to this ring, she dug into her bag and did things she doesn’t normally do because winning the NXT Women’s Championship back means so much to her. She had Kelani in the ankle lock with nowhere to go and she took the cheap way out.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And that could have been Kendal’s last shot going after that title, but after this week she finally has the words to describe what happened-- that was bullshit, she says censored by the CW. She says Jordan disrespected her and the title and she’s not gonna stand here and let her do that, and somehow, some way, she’s gonna be your next NXT Women’s Champion.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter Kelani Jordan.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">She leads Grey in some deep breathing and says maybe she should add anger management to her therapy sessions, but there was only one way out and she wasn’t gonna tap, so she slapped. She proved that not only is she the most athletic person here but she’s the smartest. But she gets it, Kendal wants a rematch and she’ll get it some day, but not for a while.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Because you know what happens when you smack an official, right? SUSPENSION! She’s honestly so smart, and she got the idea from Grey’s pal Wren Sinclair who got thirty days off for hitting an official, so Kelani’s thinking she’s probably gonna get 90 days off and she’ll see her next year, so happy new year.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter general manager Robert Stone.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says what Jordan did last week was despicable and she agrees and tells him to go ahead and suspend her. Stone says he can do that but it’d be a suspension from all of WWE, not just NXT, and she’d miss the John Cena Classic. Jordan isn’t okay with that, and Robert says he’s gotta do what’s best for business, so he’s not going to suspend her, he’s gonna give Kendal a rematch.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Jordan says she can’t promise the same thing won’t happen again and Stone says that’s fine because this time they won’t need a referee since on December 12 she’s gonna defend the title in a Tables, Ladders, and Chairs match!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Mason Rook is shown warming up backstage when Grayson Waller rolls up.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Rook says Waller can’t leave him alone, Grayson says he’s just checking out a prospective opponent but he doesn’t really think Mason has what it takes. Shiloh Hill has what it takes to do whatever he has to to win the title, but Rook is just a big man who can do a moonsault who will choke when he gets the big match.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Mason takes offense, Grayson says NXT kept rolling without him, Rook says this is his time and Waller eggs him on, telling him to prove it.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Vanity Project make their entrance and send us to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial in time for the bell!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><div id="hank-and-tank-hank-walker-tank-ledger-noam-dar-romeo-moreno-vs-vanity-project-brad-baylor-jackson-drake-myka-lockwood-ricky-smokes" class="llmywu2 llmywu0 duet--article--standard-heading _1mt21p01"><h3 class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup">Hank and Tank (Hank Walker & Tank Ledger), Noam Dar, & Romeo Moreno vs. Vanity Project (Brad Baylor, Jackson Drake, Myka Lockwood, & Ricky Smokes)</h3></div></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Dar to start for the babyface team, immediately Lockwood is tagged in opposite him and he backs off but nobody wants to tag in against her! Myka pulls him in, scoop and a slam, Dar dives for the tag but Moreno is busy tying his shoes! Hank and Tank play Rock Paper Scissors for it and Ledger tags in! Knuckle lock, Lockwood wrenches his arm down, Test of Strength, pulling him in, struggling, neither competitor able to get much of an advantage!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Myka slips out, tries for a slam, Tank slips away and tags Walker in! All three of his teammates give the former security guard a pep talk, he’s fired up, off the ropes, drop down, leapfrog, Lockwood with a goozle but Hank shoves her hand into Drake and tags her out! Taking Jackson into the corner, tag to Dar, he takes a piggyback ride for a HONK HONK Stinger Splash!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Double chickenwing, tag to Ledger, working Drake over, arm wringer, Jackson slips out, enzuigiri, tag to Smokes! Hip toss from Tank, tag to Moreno, Romeo takes a piggyback ride for a splash on Ricky… NOPE! Action spills to the floor, Romeo boots Ricky off the apron and low-bridges Lockwood to the floor, off the ropes but Myka slides back in to block! Vanity Project on the apron, the boys get pulled down, Lockwood grabs Hank and Tank… MORENO SPRINGBOARDS OVER HER TO TAKE THE BOYS OUT AND SEND US TO BREAK!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Drake is working Moreno over, quick tags, Romeo gets some separation but Lockwood is in and goozles him! Moreno floats over, puts her shoulder-first into the post, tags made and it’s Ledger and Smokes legal! Tank cleaning house, Lawn Darting Jackson and throwing him to the floor, Full Nelson Bomb on Baylor, malfunction at the junction and he elbows Moreno to the floor!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Dar takes offense and argues with Tank until they notice Myka in the background and charge her but she takes them down with a double lariat and finally chokeslams Romeo! Drake tags in, nobody home on the 450 splash, Noam cuts him off with a back elbow and Brad breaks it up! Match breaks down into “everybody do something cool” territory and Lockwood slams Tank like he’s a sack of potatoes!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">An elbow staggers Walker, Myka climbs up with him… AND SHE HITS THE SUPERPLEX AND BRIDGES BACK UP TO STANDING! She grabs Jackson in a military press… AND SLAMS HIM OVER THE ROPES INTO THE BABYFACE TEAM! Noam rolls her up from behind… NO DEAL! Lockwood hosses him up…</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01"><strong>Vanity Project win by pinfall with a powerbomb lift into a tossing powerslam from Myka Lockwood on Noam Dar.</strong></p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">We get a video package for Izzi Dame vs. Zaria.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Izzi Dame is interviewed in the locker room.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">She says Zaria has been behaving exactly as she’s expected her to and she is in fact shaken by her.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Kali Armstrong and Lizzy Rain step forward and both say they want the winner and Dame pushes through and says while they’re talking about hoping to be champion she’s gonna go win a championship.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And so we go to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Vanity Project are still in the ring, celebrating.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Jackson Drake says that’s four up, four down, and they’re the best faction in NXT, draped in gold with the baddest woman in the game. Brad Baylor talks up Myka Lockwood’s debut and says nobody’s beating her. Ricky Smokes says the women’s division better look out and Drake says they’re the best despite having a general manager that hates them and troglodyte wrestling fans don’t appreciate them and John Cena’s sleeping on them.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">They dominate this show every week and Cena picks Zilla Fatu over him? Smokes says the Doctor of Thuganomics turned into the Doctor of Neponomics and they agree that Cena doesn’t know how to scout talent but it’s all good.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter Zilla Fatu.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says John Cena didn’t pick Jackson because his attitude needs a little adjustment, and before Dion Lennox put hands on him he was gonna be the next NXT Champion instead of watching from afar while Shiloh Hill and Mason Rook have next. But how about the Main One show Jackson some hustle, loyalty, and respect and take that North American Championship to Disney with him.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter Kam Hendrix.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says he’s with Drake, Cena wouldn’t know talent if it was standing in front of him because he gave him a match against EK Prosper instead of a briefcase. Zilla’s got the best family tree, he’s the best all-around athlete in NXT and he beat Tony D’Angelo last week so if anybody deserves a shot at the North American Championship it’s him.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter EK Prosper.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says Kam didn’t beat Tony, Myles Borne beat Tony, and Hendrix says record books don’t have pictures, dumbass. Prosper says there’s no way he’s getting a title match over him and he knows that makes Drake scared since the last time they wrestled he had him beat, and so he’s got next, and this time he will prosper.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Enter Tristan Angels.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He calls the crowd tossers and tells them to zip it before saying he’s actually proving he’s championship worthy by besting Saquon Shugars and Sean Legacy at the same time, something requiring brawn and wit and let him share an evening with a woman who had fantastic-- That’s not the point, he’s the total package and if anyone deserves a shot, it’s the most handsome man in England and therefore the entire world, Tristan Ang-- EK PROSPER LAYS HIM OUT AND WE GET A BRAWL!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Prosper and Fatu send the Vanity Project packing and then fend off Angels and Hendrix and stand tall!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Excellent weirdo Shiloh Hill is warming up in the locker room when Grayson Waller rolls up.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says Mason Rook has a look in his eye like he’s gonna do anything tonight, and he’s not sure Hill can do the same. He’s got all this passion and energy but he’s not a killer. He tells Shiloh he’s only got one chance and Rook will break every bone in his body, can he say the same? Hill says he’s gonna show everyone why no one sleeps on Shiloh Hill.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And so we go to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, WrenQCC roll up into the locker room.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Wren Sinclair is worried that the TLC match might be too intense for Kendal Grey but they’ll train her for it together. But tonight, Wren wants to pay attention to Zaria and Izzi Dame because she’s going after the North American Championship. Kendal says that’s a great idea and Lizzy Rain and Kali Armstrong pop up to stake their claims to that title.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Excellent weirdo Shiloh Hill makes his entrance ahead of our next contest.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><div id="mason-rook-vs-shiloh-hill-nxt-mens-championship-1-contenders-match" class="llmywu2 llmywu0 duet--article--standard-heading _1mt21p01"><h3 class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup">Mason Rook vs. Shiloh Hill (NXT Men’s Championship #1 Contender’s Match)</h3></div></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Collar and elbow, struggling into the ropes, breaking and going right back to the lockup, Hill with a side headlock, trying for the takeover but Rook is a little too hefty. Off the ropes, shoulder block, both men unmoved, another try, Shiloh floats over and puts Mason face-first into the turnbuckles! Rook returns the favor and wrenches in a side headlock!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Headlock takeover, grinding Hill down, putting him in the corner for Stinger Splashes, scoop and a slam, big senton connects and he gets a nearfall and sends us to break!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Hill presses the attack, lays him out, imploding standing senton atomico… SO CLOSE! Shiloh dives… ROOK COUNTERS WITH A SPINEBUSTER FOR A CLOSE THREE! Blue Thunder Driver follows it up but Hill kicks out again! Action to the floor, Mason rams him into the apron and then into the announce desk, back in the ring Shiloh takes the initiative with a lariat for two!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Hill with a DDT for another nearfall, Rook with a crossbody block, a Doctor Bomb, he goes up top…</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01"><strong>Mason Rook wins by pinfall with the diving moonsault, becoming #1 contender to the NXT Men’s Championship.</strong></p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Post-match, Rook offers a handshake and pulls Hill in for a hug when he accepts.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Grayson Waller comes down the aisle and cold shoulders Shiloh, who rushes him from behind and throws him in the ring so Mason can hit the Blue Thunder Driver! Rook grabs the NXT Men’s Championship and holds it up over Waller!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Thea Hail is having her makeup and hair done backstage and chatting with the artists when Chantel Monroe rolls up to ask why she’s so worried about covering up her face when she’s literally balding and then yanks a shank of her hair aside to show her bald spot. Thea storms off, quite reasonably.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And so we go to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Myles Borne sends in a video promo where he says he’s not stalking Tony D’Angelo, he’s studying him because he’s accomplished everything in NXT and he’s somewhere Myles wants to be, the top. So he had to make some noise to get noticed, and he complains about kicking out in their #1 contender’s match before Halloween Havoc.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">So he didn’t complain, it was a gut check, and everyone doesn’t see that he’s a main event player. So he focused on putting Tavion Heights away and did just that, and now he’s coming for the pillar of NXT just like Tony did.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He walks over to his truck and pulls a note out of the window that says if he wants to follow him, he’ll meet him next week.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Thea Hail walks to the ring, mic in hand while commentary is talking about stuff and gets on the mic.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">She asks if you know how long every girl sits in the hair and makeup chair in the back just so they don’t get shredded to bits because their extensions don’t match or their gear isn’t good enough. Everybody has an opinion and you can imagine how scared she was to share she was diagnosed with alopecia at 23 years old.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">She’d love to lie and say she’s super optimistic about this and in four months she’s lost about 40% of her hair and she’s wondering what everbody is-- will it grow back, what will it look at, how will people look at her with no hair? Chantel Monroe gave her an answer very quickly and made her feel small and defeated when a part of her life she wasn’t ready to share got exposed.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">So she needs to turn weakness into strength and alopecia has been a blessing in some ways, exposing how quick people are to judge. Maybe the world would be better if we spent less time judging on appearances and more time evaluating people on who they are. We should be kind to people who are different and stop living our lives trying to meet someone else’s version of perfection.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And she’s talking to Chantel Monroe too, she refuses to let her crueltty make her ashamed of who she is and she’s spent her entire career trying to prove she doesn’t stay down, and with or without hair, she’s Thea Hail, and in world where nobody knows what’s real or what’s not, this is.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And saying that, she whips an electric clipper out of her pocket and starts shaving her head.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">She gets about to a 2001 Devin Townsend before we go to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial we get a 30 Years of the Rock video about Rocky attacking Cody Rhodes that one time and making him bleed in the parking lot.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Another video package for Izzi Dame vs. Zaria plays.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Birth Right is in the ring for a tag team match and Perros del Mal make their entrance.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><div id="birth-right-channing-stacks-lorenzo-uriah-connors-vs-los-garza-angel-garza-humberto-carrillo" class="llmywu2 llmywu0 duet--article--standard-heading _1mt21p01"><h3 class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup">Birth Right (Channing “Stacks” Lorenzo & Uriah Connors) vs. Los Garza (Angel Garza & Humberto Carrillo)</h3></div></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Chaotic brawling out the gates, Garza getting worked over as things finally settle down, quick tag to Lorenzo, put him into the corner, tag to Connors, soon enough Carrillo tags in and works Uriah over! Setting him up top, tag to Angel, Los Garza in control as we go to break!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Birth Right working Garza over, throwing Mongolian chops at Stacks, Connors tags in, Lorenzo with a back elbow, Uriah with a senton atomico for two! Angel passes him to the floor and back body drops one of Birth Right’s blondes into the tag team on the floor! Tag to Carrillo, getting Uriah in the ropes and he lays in the Beats of the Bodhran!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Powerslam for Stacks when he runs in, deadlift one-arm powerbomb… CHANNING BREAKS IT UP AND GARZA CACTUS CLOTHESLINES HIM TO THE FLOOR! Humberto up top and perching but DarkState is here to distract him! Karmen Petrovic grabs Arianna Grace’s leg, somebody Sabus Carrillo while the referee isn’t looking…</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01"><strong>Birth Right win by pinfall with a lateral press from Uriah Connors on Humberto Carrillo.</strong></p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Backstage, Saquon Shugars is chatting with Sean Legacy about how it makes no sense for Tristan Angels, not from North America, to challenge for the North American Championship.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">They bicker about the three-way, Sean says he was trying to help and Saquon says he doesn’t want his help. Legacy challenges him to a match next week, calling him one of the most talented wrestlers he’s seen, nobody walks, talks, dresses, or wrestles like him, but until he realizes he’s his own worst enemy he’s never gonna get anywhere.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">And so we go to break.</p></div><div class="duet--article--block-placement tswlmh1 tswlmh0 duet--article--article-body-component"><hr class="duet--article--divider _1upudxkj _1yo97ej0"/></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, we get footage of ASMR John Cena giving John Cena Classic invites to the WrenQCC, with Wren Sinclair adorably excited about the metal Halliburton suitcase because of stories Norman Smiley told her.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">General manager Robert Stone is interviewed backstage.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">He says we know all eight NXT superstars in the John Cena Classic and he couldn’t be more proud, and next week all four Men’s North American Championship contenders from today’s segment will meet in a four-way next week, the winner getting Jackson Drake at TLC. And Dion Lennox vs. Lexis King vs. Daga will happen next week to try and defuse the faction warfare.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Izzi Dame makes her entrance ahead of our main event, followed thereafter by Zaria.</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><div id="izzi-dame-vs-zaria-c-nxt-womens-north-american-championship" class="llmywu2 llmywu0 duet--article--standard-heading _1mt21p01"><h3 class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup">Izzi Dame vs. Zaria (c) (NXT Women’s North American Championship)</h3></div></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Zaria in control out the gates, throwing Dame around and then to the floor! Out after her, Izzi throws a hard elbow and rams her into the apron to get back in the fight! Champion ducks a chop and throws one of her own, pulls Dame out of the ring when she tries to go back in and throws her face-first into the ring bell!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back inside, Izzi scrambles to get away, shoulder blocks in the corner, both women end up down and out and we go to break!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back from commercial, Dame with a crucifix driver nearfall, forehead-to-forehead, trading elbows and Izzi blasts her down with a boot! Off the ropes, Zaria sends her to the apron with a superkick but Dame cuts her off with a knee and goes up top and dives into a headbutt from the champion… SO CLOSE!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Out to the apron, Zaria with a forearm, trying to deadlift her over the ropes, over to the turnbuckles, jockeying for position, Izzi lands a diving Codebreaker… STILL NO! Dame laying chops in and walking her across the ring, talking trash and Zaria lights her up with huge chops in return! Knee in the corner, big high-angle German suplex, discus lariat… IZZI KICKS OUT!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Dame gets a spear, Zaria kicks out, Izzi with the Tenryu Powerbomb… ZARIA WILL NOT STAY DOWN! Dame goes to the floor and messes with the title belt, Zaria spears her out of her boots, back inside, the title is in the champion’s hands, Izzi charges in, she lets go of the belt and hits the F-5… BUT DAME IS IN THE ROPES!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">Back to the floor, Izzi dropkicks Zaria through the damn LED board barricade! Back inside, Busaiku knee… IT’S OVER!</p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01"><strong>Izzi Dame wins by pinfall with the Busaiku knee, becoming the new NXT Women’s North American Champion.</strong></p></div><div class="duet--article--article-body-component"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1upudxki _174s0un1 _174s0un0 _1mt21p01">That’s the show, folks.</p></div><div class="xyhwua0"><span class="xyhwua1">See More<!-- -->:<span class="xyhwua2"> </span></span><ul class="_9og5wrf"><li class="_9og5wr0 y89k680"><a href="/wwe" class="_9og5wr9">WWE</a></li><li class="_9og5wr0 y89k680"><a href="/wwe-nxt" class="_9og5wr9">WWE NXT</a></li><li class="_9og5wr0 y89k680"><a href="/wwe-nxt-live-blogs" class="_9og5wr9">WWE NXT: Live Blogs</a></li></ul></div></div></div><!--$--><div class="duet--layout--rail u5eita0 u5eita1"><div class="u5eita2 u5eita4 u5eita8"><div class="_1rpokx31w _1rpokx30 _1rpokx32i"><div class="_1rpokx30 _1rpokx31x" data-concert="medium_rectangle_variable"></div></div></div><div class="u5eita2 u5eita5 u5eita8"></div><div class="u5eita2 u5eita8"><div><div class="_1rpokx32a _1rpokx30 _1rpokx32i"><div class="_1rpokx30 _1rpokx32b" data-concert="medium_rectangle_gamestop_desktop"></div></div><div class="_1rpokx326 _1rpokx30 _1rpokx32i"><div class="_1rpokx30 _1rpokx327" data-concert="connatix_right_rail"></div></div></div></div><div class="u5eita2 u5eita6 u5eita8"><section class="_799psc0" aria-labelledby="sbn-app-promo-title"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 53 53" class="_799psc1" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="53" height="53" rx="11" fill="#0033FF"></rect><path fill="#fff" transform="translate(5.8489 12) scale(0.302262 0.285796)" d="M125.378 34.609c2.807 0 5.503-1.097 7.512-3.054a10.74 10.74 0 0 0 3.243-7.424v-6.47C136.133 7.075 129.277 0 119.469 0H71.114v69.98h48.492c8.292 0 16.538-6.375 16.538-17.132v-7.503a10.744 10.744 0 0 0-3.157-7.594 10.769 10.769 0 0 0-7.609-3.142Zm-14.93